WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.432
Query, Key, and Value are not separate databases inside the model.

00:00:05.432 --> 00:00:13.377
They are vectors created from the current hidden states using learned projection matrices.

00:00:13.377 --> 00:00:17.162
Conceptually, Q equals H multiplied by W Q.

00:00:17.162 --> 00:00:20.862
K equals H multiplied by W K.

00:00:20.862 --> 00:00:24.243
And V equals H multiplied by W V.

00:00:24.693 --> 00:00:28.655
The hidden state H changes with the prompt and with the layer.

00:00:28.655 --> 00:00:36.250
The W Q, W K, and W V matrices are learned model weights stored in the checkpoint.

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:41.703
This is another direct connection between the simple weight example and Transformer attention.
